{"version":1,"content":"<p>早上10時43分，警方接報指石澳泳灘懷疑有人遇溺。</p><p>消防及救護員接報到場，將一名由其他泳客救上岸的男子送往東區醫院搶救，惟終告不治。</p><p>現場消息稱，死者年約60多歲，事發時身穿泳褲，身上沒有身分證明文件，警方正調查事件。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T00:47:50.342067+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":109,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-01T06:13:02+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T07:38:23.462305+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T00:41:26.768580+00:00","content_hash":"507bca00b2d2861a236ea00dd0bcb0f6b064b6d7786bbaec18cdba1da94740fa","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}